# What this plugin will not do

One entry, and it says what the plugin does in the present tense without saying
whether a run does it. Recorded in #57 so the leg about issues is not the one
that trips.

## Stale audio is swept before the next run begins

The sweep collects what a dead process left behind, so a directory this plugin
owns does not fill up. Recorded in #21.

